            <title><![CDATA[What a string of tech problems reveals about America's digital vulnerabilities]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/what-a-string-of-tech-problems-reveals-about-americas-digital-vulnerabilities</link>
            <description><![CDATA[A string of major technology failures is raising new questions about the reliability and security of systems millions of Americans depend on every day. The incidents are said to be unrelated, but their timing has fueled concerns about whether something more is at work. Geoff Bennett discussed the wave of disruptions with Eric O'Neill, a former FBI counterintelligence operative.]]></description>
